@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Player" as Employee
participant "System" as System

activate Employee

    Employee -> System : asks to assign a route to a train
    activate System

        System --> Employee : shows available locomotives and stations to create a route to
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : selects a beginning and an ending station, other stations \n as stops in between and a locomotive to be assigned
    activate System

        System --> Employee : checks if there is railways between the selected stations, \n alerts if there are no railways between situation \n and shows available cargo to be picked up
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : chooses the cargo to be picked up
    activate System

        System --> Employee : shows all data and requests confirmation
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : confirms route
    activate System

        System --> Employee : assigns the train to the route and displays success
    deactivate System
@enduml